facts and combos are waiting for you!Remember - your feedback is a precious ingredient for the game development! Let us know what you think about your alchemical adventure.Already played the demo? Then take a sneak peek at what awaits you in the full version.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691301","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3967230-1846018067941862","game_id":"steam-3967230","kind":"update","title":"Yet Another Demo Update!","summary":"Yet Another Demo Update!We're still working diligently to address your feedback on the game. This time around, we have some changes designed to tighten the gameplay experience, reduce information overload, and give you more interesting choices.ChangesAbility slot counts for larger items have been reduced. Now, each item gets 1 ability slot per cell it occupies. Large items previously had inflated ability counts. This change makes choosing abilities more impactful, as well as reducing the informa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T17:39:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941862","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3967230-1845383656394451","game_id":"steam-3967230","kind":"update","title":"Here's another demo update!","summary":"Here's another demo update!As stated before, we're constantly addressing your feedback and pushing relevant changes to the demo build. This time, we have reworked bosses!Boss ReworkBosses no longer have legendary abilities. Instead, they now have Blessing abilities, which are designed to be much more impactful against the player. You can view a boss's blessings ahead of time by clicking the \"Stronghold\" button, so you can plan your board accordinglyBoss blessings are unique, so the same blessing","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T19:19:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656394451","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3967230-1845383656378493","game_id":"steam-3967230","kind":"update","title":"Alchemortis Demo Update!","summary":"Alchemortis Demo Update!Work continues on Alchemortis! As part of getting the game ready for release, we are committed to updating the demo with fixes and quality of life improvements as they are ready. A big thank you to everyone who tested the beta branch and shared feedback! New FeaturesBosses now each have a tailor-made legendary ability pool along with new legendary abilities, making them more challengingYou can now see the next upcoming boss via the UIAdded region names, flavor text, and c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T17:35:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656378493","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3967230-1844115010498889","game_id":"steam-3967230","kind":"announcement","title":"Alchemortis DEMO is out now!","summary":"ALCHEMISTS,A free DEMO for Alchemortis is now available!Try out two playable characters and get a taste of Alchemortis before the full game releases!ABOUT ALCHEMORTIS:Gather and merge the items to boost their stats,Organize your inventory to unlock powerful synergies,Experiment, optimize, and craft the perfect build through the power of alchemy!Don't forget to share your feedback!Brew wisely!Firebelley & FeardemicPatch NotesMajor Changes- Demo Build - The demo build has roughly 40-50% of the con","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T13:10:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010498889","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3967230-1840944183773994","game_id":"steam-3967230","kind":"announcement","title":"LAST CHANCE to join the OPEN PLAYTEST!","summary":"ALCHEMISTS,This is your last chance to join the OPEN PLAYTEST for Alchemortis!Sign up and play before it closes on Friday, August 14 at 7 AM PT | 16 CEST.And if you played already - remember to leave your feedback on Steam discussion or the official Discord server!Brew wisely!Firebelley & Feardemic","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T13:30:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183773994","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3967230-1839041357035645","game_id":"steam-3967230","kind":"announcement","title":"Summer OPEN PLAYTEST is now LIVE.","summary":"ALCHEMISTS,The cauldron is bubbling once more - a new OPEN PLAYTEST for Alchemortis is now LIVE!If you signed up for the playtest previously, you don't have to do it again - the playtest should be available in your Steam library.Jump in and experience the updated world of Alchemortis, featuring new items, visual improvements, QoL and much more.What's new?20+ new itemsfull controller supportunlock tree, crit, character and other reworkslegendary alchemy reagentsupdated and new art & audioand much","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-27T13:03:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357035645","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3967230-1835236783563537","game_id":"steam-3967230","kind":"announcement","title":"OPEN PLAYTEST is closing SOON!","summary":"Alchemists,The open playtest is closing soon!Join it and experience the alchemy-based roguelike before it ends on Tuesday, June 16 at 7 AM PT | 16 CEST.And if you played already - remember to leave your feedback on Steam discussion or the official Discord server!Brew wisely!Firebelley & Feardemic","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-12T13:51:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783563537","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3967230-1833968530895415","game_id":"steam-3967230","kind":"announcement","title":"OPEN PLAYTEST is now LIVE!","summary":"Welcome, Alchemist! Discover the dark world of Alchemortis - the open playtest has begun! Try it now!Open playtest contains: 5 characters (4 to unlock!)190+ items (40 new ones)every run has 3 stages - each with a boss at the end!8 difficulty levels (to ramp up the challenge!)dozens of Artifactscountless synergies and limitless ways to \"break the game!\"Have fun exploring the game and remember that YOUR VOICE MATTERS - your feedback is the key to making the Alchemortis the best it can be. Share yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-31T14:14:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530895415","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3967230-1829528821315400","game_id":"steam-3967230","kind":"announcement","title":"Alchemortis is available for playtesting!","summary":"Alchemortis is available for playtesting!The fourth Alchemortis playtest is now live for everyone!A lot has changed in this version of the game. I would love to hear your thoughts about the changes. Please be sure to join the Discord to leave your feedback: https://discord.gg/4DYepmB3djI hope you enjoy, and thank you for your support!FirebelleyPatch NotesMap Gameplay OverhaulThe map has received a significant rework.The map is no longer free roam. The map is now vertically oriented, with directe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-13T13:09:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821315400","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3967230-1823825466499732","game_id":"steam-3967230","kind":"announcement","title":"New Alchemortis Playtest Live Now!","summary":"Playtest 3 is Available Now!The third Alchemortis playtest is now live for everyone! This build is focused on addressing some of the major issues of the previous playtest, but also contains a lot of new content. Below are the complete patch notes for this playtest.Please be sure to join the Discord to leave your feedback: https://discord.gg/4DYepmB3dj Thank you everyone, and I appreciate your support!FirebelleyPatch NotesAlchemy OverhaulLegendary cards will now have a random legendary ability ad","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-06T14:13:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823825466499732","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3967230":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:09Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:09Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3967230":"2026-10-26T11:21:09Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3967230":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11